{"path":"io/basic_ispanstream/swap2","title":"std::swap(std::basic_ispanstream)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>swap<small>(std::basic_ispanstream)</small>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ispanstream/swap2","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Overloads the std::swap algorithm for std::basic_ispanstream. Exchanges the state of lhs with that of rhs. Effectively calls lhs.swap(rhs).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/spanstream\">&lt;spanstream&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ispanstream\"><span class=\"kw3387\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ispanstream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ispanstream\"><span class=\"kw3387\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ispanstream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Overloads the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\">std::swap</a></span> algorithm for <span class=\"t-lc\">std::basic_ispanstream</span>. Exchanges the state of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi